creatures:
- name: Behir
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 17  
      **Hit Points** 168 (rollable(dice=16d12 + 64,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** Walk 50 ft., Climb 50 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Initiative) (13)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=23)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=7)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-2,label=-2,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=14)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=18)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Perception rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Perception Check), Stealth rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=Stealth Check)  
      **Damage Immunities** lightning  
      **Senses** darkvision 90 ft., Passive Perception 16  
      **Languages** Draconic  
      **Challenge** 11 (7,200 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +4  

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The behir makes one Bite attack and uses Constrict.

      ***Bite.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+10,label=+10,dicelabel=To Hit [Bite]), reach 10 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d12+6,dicelabel=Damage [Bite]) Piercing damage plus rollable(dice=2d10,dicelabel=Damage [Bite]) Lightning damage.

      ***Constrict.*** *Strength Saving Throw:* DC 18, one Large or smaller creature the behir can see within 5 feet. *Failure:* rollable(dice=5d8+6,dicelabel=Damage [Constrict]) Bludgeoning damage. The target has the ***Grappled*** condition (escape DC 16), and it has the ***Restrained*** condition until the grapple ends.

      ***Lightning Breath (rollable(dice=1d6,label=Recharge 5-6,dicelabel=Recharge [Lightning Breath])).*** *Dexterity Saving Throw:* DC 16, each creature in a 90-foot-long, 5-foot-wide ***Line***. *Failure:* rollable(dice=12d10,dicelabel=Damage [Lightning Breath]) Lightning damage. *Success:* Half damage.

      ## Bonus Actions

      ***Swallow.*** *Dexterity Saving Throw:* DC 18, one Large or smaller creature ***Grappled*** by the behir (the behir can have only one creature swallowed at a time). *Failure:* The behir swallows the target, which is no longer ***Grappled***. While swallowed, a creature has the ***Blinded*** and ***Restrained*** conditions, has ***Total Cover*** against attacks and other effects outside the behir, and takes rollable(dice=6d6,dicelabel=Damage [Swallow]) Acid damage at the start of each of the behir's turns.

      If the behir takes 30 damage or more on a single turn from the swallowed creature, the behir must succeed on a DC 14 Constitution saving throw at the end of that turn or regurgitate the creature, which falls in a space within 10 feet of the behir and has the ***Prone*** condition. If the behir dies, a swallowed creature is no longer ***Restrained*** and can escape from the corpse by using 15 feet of movement, exiting ***Prone***.

    type: custom
  blurb: |
    # $[objectname]

    *Huge Monstrosity, Neutral Evil*  
    **Challenge** 11
  subtype: npc
  id: srd2024behir
  status: 1

